# A single pillar has no phase reference: the phase of the kick changes nothing.
# Reference: the arrival and peak of the kick of amplitude 2 with zero phase.
title One pillar, kick with a quarter-turn of phase
sites 1
kick 1 amplitude=2 phase=90
run 600
expect total 1
expect last 12.58257 0.003
expect count 1 1
expect arrival 1 12.58257 0.003
expect peak 1 58.753057 2e-4
expect arrival 1 12.58251 0.003
